  "description": "`Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Providers.HidSharp` is a backend provider for [Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Smdn.IO.UsbHid.Abstractions)\nthat utilizes the [HIDSharp](https://github.com/SeekHisKingdom/HIDSharp/) library for hardware communication.\nIt enables applications using the `Smdn.IO.UsbHid.*` abstraction layer to operate on HID devices through the `HIDSharp` implementation.\n\nNote: Although this package is marked with `IsAotCompatible=true`, the underlying HIDSharp library does not claim AOT compatibility\nand is not marked as such. As a result, warnings such as `IL3058` may be reported during AOT-enabled compilation.",
